        "name": "anhang_a3",
        "description": "Anhang A3 - Das Kaleidoskop hoert zu (Audio-Mappings + Wellenform-Seed) (generiert aus PimpedKaleidoscope-tutorial.md, SSOT dort)",
        "imageInput": [
          0,
